From a99e9fa09e3d51d8bd519f4f9ef61be384310852 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 15:56:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] tla: restore only persisted log entries on restart

PersistState recorded only the length of the log, and Restart restored the
in-memory log truncated to that length. If entries were overwritten in
memory after they were persisted (a follower accepting a new leader's
entries before its next Ready), a restart kept entries that were never
persisted and lost persisted ones.

This alone lets MCetcdraft elect two leaders in one term, even once the
spec models the code's conf change rules (later in this series): a
restarted node holds a newer leader's config entries with an older commit
index and config, wins an election on the old config, while another node
wins on the new config in the same term (RestartWitness, 78 steps).

Persist the log itself, restore it on restart, and compare against its
length in CommittedIsDurableInv.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 tla/etcdraft.tla | 11 +++++++----
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/tla/etcdraft.tla b/tla/etcdraft.tla
index 7828474..4591ad9 100644
--- a/tla/etcdraft.tla
+++ b/tla/etcdraft.tla
@@ -226,11 +226,14 @@ CommitTo(i, c) ==
 
 CurrentLeaders == {i \in Server : state[i] = Leader}
 
+\* The persisted state includes the log itself, not only its length: entries
+\* can be overwritten in memory after they were persisted, and a restart must
+\* restore the persisted ones.
 PersistState(i) == 
     durableState' = [durableState EXCEPT ![i] = [
         currentTerm |-> currentTerm[i],
         votedFor |-> votedFor[i],
-        log |-> Len(log[i]),
+        log |-> log[i],
         commitIndex |-> commitIndex[i],
         config |-> config[i]
     ]]
@@ -254,7 +257,7 @@ InitDurableState ==
     durableState = [ i \in Server |-> [
         currentTerm |-> currentTerm[i],
         votedFor |-> votedFor[i],
-        log |-> Len(log[i]),
+        log |-> log[i],
         commitIndex |-> commitIndex[i],
         config |-> config[i]
     ]]
@@ -283,7 +286,7 @@ Restart(i) ==
     /\ currentTerm' = [currentTerm EXCEPT ![i] = durableState[i].currentTerm]
     /\ commitIndex' = [commitIndex EXCEPT ![i] = durableState[i].commitIndex]
     /\ votedFor' = [votedFor EXCEPT ![i] = durableState[i].votedFor]
-    /\ log' = [log EXCEPT ![i] = SubSeq(@, 1, durableState[i].log)]
+    /\ log' = [log EXCEPT ![i] = durableState[i].log]
     /\ config' = [config EXCEPT ![i] = durableState[i].config]
     /\ UNCHANGED <<messages, durableState, reconfigCount>>
 
@@ -871,7 +874,7 @@ LeaderCompletenessInv ==
 \* Any entry committed by leader shall be persisted already
 CommittedIsDurableInv ==
     \A i \in Server :
-        state[i] = Leader => commitIndex[i] <= durableState[i].log
+        state[i] = Leader => commitIndex[i] <= Len(durableState[i].log)
 
 -----
 
